# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a learning experiment for the latest version of Qiskit noise learning"
msgstr "Construiește un experiment de învățare pentru cea mai recentă versiune a Qiskit noise learning"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a learning experiment"
msgstr "Construiește un experiment de învățare"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a learning experiment {#build-a-learning-experiment}"
msgstr "Construiește un experiment de învățare {#build-a-learning-experiment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tutorial demonstrates how to build a standard learning experiment from scratch, and use it to learn a model from simulated noisy data.\n"
msgstr "Acest tutorial arată cum să construiești de la zero un experiment de învățare standard și să îl folosești pentru a învăța un model din date zgomotoase simulate.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define a gate set on a ring of qubits\n"
msgstr "Definește un set de porți pe un inel de qubiți\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a 2-local Pauli-Lindblad model\n"
msgstr "Alege un model Pauli-Lindblad 2-local\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build the learning experiment\n"
msgstr "Construiește experimentul de învățare\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '4.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate circuits\n"
msgstr "Generează circuitele\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '5.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up local simulation\n"
msgstr "Configurează simularea locală\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '6.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the program\n"
msgstr "Rulează programul\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '7.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Analyze the data\n"
msgstr "Analizează datele\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Running on real hardware\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  The circuits below are simulated locally, so this walkthrough needs no IBM Quantum® credentials. To alternatively run it on a real device:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Rulare pe hardware real\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  Circuitele de mai jos sunt simulate local, așa că acest ghid nu necesită credențiale IBM Quantum®. Pentru a-l rula în schimb pe un dispozitiv real:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '  *   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1**: replace [`FakeMarrakesh`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/fake-provider-fake-marrakesh \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") with a real backend.\n"
msgstr "**Pasul 1**: înlocuiește [`FakeMarrakesh`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/fake-provider-fake-marrakesh \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") cu un Backend real.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  *   **Step 5**: pass that backend as the executor’s mode, and drop the simulator options.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  *   **Pasul 5**: transmite acel Backend ca mod al executorului și elimină opțiunile simulatorului.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"define-a-gate-set-on-a-ring-of-qubits\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Define a gate set on a ring of qubits {#1-define-a-gate-set-on-a-ring-of-qubits}"
msgstr "1. Definește un set de porți pe un inel de qubiți {#1-define-a-gate-set-on-a-ring-of-qubits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a [`QiskitGateSet`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/gate-sets-qiskit-gate-set#qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.QiskitGateSet \"qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.QiskitGateSet\") from a backend [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) and a subset of its qubits — here a twelve-qubit ring of [`FakeMarrakesh`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/fake-provider-fake-marrakesh \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") — then add one gate to it: a layer of six `CZ` gates covering that ring. By default the gate set is initialized with a preparation gate `P` and a measurement gate `M`.\n"
msgstr "Construiește un [`QiskitGateSet`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/gate-sets-qiskit-gate-set#qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.QiskitGateSet \"qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.QiskitGateSet\") dintr-un [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) de Backend și un subset al qubiților săi — aici un inel de doisprezece qubiți al [`FakeMarrakesh`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/fake-provider-fake-marrakesh \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") — apoi adaugă-i o poartă: un strat de șase porți `CZ` care acoperă acel inel. Implicit, setul de porți este inițializat cu o poartă de pregătire `P` și o poartă de măsurare `M`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Running on real hardware\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Rulare pe hardware real\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Call [`draw()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/gate-sets-gate-set#qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.GateSet.draw \"qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.GateSet.draw\") to see the gate on the device topology: the ring of qubits in the gate set, and which pairs of them the gate entangles.\n"
msgstr "Apelează [`draw()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/gate-sets-gate-set#qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.GateSet.draw \"qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.GateSet.draw\") pentru a vedea poarta pe topologia dispozitivului: inelul de qubiți din setul de porți și care perechi dintre ei sunt încâlcite de poartă.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"choose-a-2-local-pauli-lindblad-model\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Choose a 2-local Pauli-Lindblad model {#2-choose-a-2-local-pauli-lindblad-model}"
msgstr "2. Alege un model Pauli-Lindblad 2-local {#2-choose-a-2-local-pauli-lindblad-model}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Decide which Pauli-Lindblad generators the noise is allowed to have with a [`PauliLindbladModel`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/models-pauli-lindblad-model#qiskit_noise_learning.models.PauliLindbladModel \"qiskit_noise_learning.models.PauliLindbladModel\"). Build that generator set from the gate set’s connectivity with [`k_local()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/models-pauli-lindblad-model#qiskit_noise_learning.models.PauliLindbladModel.k_local \"qiskit_noise_learning.models.PauliLindbladModel.k_local\") — here every 2-local Pauli on connected qubit pairs of the unitary gate, and single-qubit Paulis for preparation and measurement.\n"
msgstr "Decide ce generatori Pauli-Lindblad poate avea zgomotul cu un [`PauliLindbladModel`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/models-pauli-lindblad-model#qiskit_noise_learning.models.PauliLindbladModel \"qiskit_noise_learning.models.PauliLindbladModel\"). Construiește acel set de generatori din conectivitatea setului de porți cu [`k_local()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/models-pauli-lindblad-model#qiskit_noise_learning.models.PauliLindbladModel.k_local \"qiskit_noise_learning.models.PauliLindbladModel.k_local\") — aici fiecare Pauli 2-local pe perechile de qubiți conectați ai porții unitare și Pauli pe un singur qubit pentru pregătire și măsurare.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Display the unknown parameter count for the noise model of each gate.\n"
msgstr "Afișează numărul de parametri necunoscuți pentru modelul de zgomot al fiecărei porți.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"build-the-learning-experiment\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Build the learning experiment {#3-build-the-learning-experiment}"
msgstr "3. Construiește experimentul de învățare {#3-build-the-learning-experiment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assemble an [`Experiment`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/experiment-builder-experiment#qiskit_noise_learning.experiment_builder.Experiment \"qiskit_noise_learning.experiment_builder.Experiment\") by composing builder stages. Each stage reads what earlier stages wrote, so order matters:\n"
msgstr "Asamblează un [`Experiment`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/experiment-builder-experiment#qiskit_noise_learning.experiment_builder.Experiment \"qiskit_noise_learning.experiment_builder.Experiment\") compunând etape de construcție. Fiecare etapă citește ce au scris etapele anterioare, deci ordinea contează:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Observe design matrix rank:\n"
msgstr "Observă rangul matricei de proiectare:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"generate-circuits\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Generate circuits {#4-generate-circuits}"
msgstr "4. Generează circuitele {#4-generate-circuits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compile the experiment with an [`ExecutorCircuitGenerator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/circuit-generator-executor-circuit-generator#qiskit_noise_learning.circuit_generator.ExecutorCircuitGenerator \"qiskit_noise_learning.circuit_generator.ExecutorCircuitGenerator\"), generating a [`QuantumProgram`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/quantum-program-quantum-program \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") — one parameterized template circuit per fragment depth.\n"
msgstr "Compilează experimentul cu un [`ExecutorCircuitGenerator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/circuit-generator-executor-circuit-generator#qiskit_noise_learning.circuit_generator.ExecutorCircuitGenerator \"qiskit_noise_learning.circuit_generator.ExecutorCircuitGenerator\"), generând un [`QuantumProgram`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/quantum-program-quantum-program \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") — un circuit șablon parametrizat pentru fiecare adâncime de fragment.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Draw a template circuit to inspect.\n"
msgstr "Desenează un circuit șablon pentru a-l inspecta.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/4088c7e98baeb5b56925c6c1f276159582c5f7040fbba76de438b919210bcc5f.png](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-noise-learning/4088c7e98baeb5b56925c6c1f276159582c5f7040fbba76de438b919210bcc5f.avif)\n"
msgstr "![../\\_images/4088c7e98baeb5b56925c6c1f276159582c5f7040fbba76de438b919210bcc5f.png](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-noise-learning/4088c7e98baeb5b56925c6c1f276159582c5f7040fbba76de438b919210bcc5f.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"set-up-local-simulation\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. Set up local simulation {#5-set-up-local-simulation}"
msgstr "5. Configurează simularea locală {#5-set-up-local-simulation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To define the noise model for simulation, we use the generators already in the model with random rates to construct a [`PauliLindbladMap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliLindbladMap).\n"
msgstr "Pentru a defini modelul de zgomot pentru simulare, folosim generatorii deja existenți în model, cu rate aleatoare, pentru a construi un [`PauliLindbladMap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliLindbladMap).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Those maps are as wide as the device, since the model is expressed in `backend`’s qubit indexing, but the simulator wants each map to be as wide as the gate it applies to, with Pauli indices running over the gate’s qubits in ascending physical order. Narrow them with [`keep_qubits()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliLindbladMap#keep_qubits), which traces out everything off the ring:\n"
msgstr "Aceste hărți sunt la fel de late ca dispozitivul, deoarece modelul este exprimat în indexarea qubiților din `backend`, dar simulatorul vrea ca fiecare hartă să fie la fel de lată ca poarta căreia i se aplică, cu indicii Pauli parcurgând qubiții porții în ordine fizică crescătoare. Îngusteaz-le cu [`keep_qubits()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliLindbladMap#keep_qubits), care elimină prin urmă tot ce se află în afara inelului:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The simulator names a layer’s noise by the box instruction the layer was built from, which [`to_instruction()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/gate-sets-qiskit-gate#qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.QiskitGate.to_instruction \"qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.QiskitGate.to_instruction\") returns for any gate in the gate set. Pair each box with its map, use the stabilizer simulation method, and set `seed_simulator` to make the simulated data reproducible:\n"
msgstr "Simulatorul denumește zgomotul unui strat după instrucțiunea de cutie din care a fost construit stratul, pe care [`to_instruction()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/gate-sets-qiskit-gate#qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.QiskitGate.to_instruction \"qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.QiskitGate.to_instruction\") o returnează pentru orice poartă din setul de porți. Asociază fiecare cutie cu harta ei, folosește metoda de simulare cu stabilizatori și setează `seed_simulator` pentru a face datele simulate reproductibile:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"run-the-program\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "6. Run the program {#6-run-the-program}"
msgstr "6. Rulează programul {#6-run-the-program}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the program, then format the results with [`collect()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/circuit-generator-executor-circuit-generator#qiskit_noise_learning.circuit_generator.ExecutorCircuitGenerator.collect \"qiskit_noise_learning.circuit_generator.ExecutorCircuitGenerator.collect\"), to produce a [`Fit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/analysis-fit#qiskit_noise_learning.analysis.Fit \"qiskit_noise_learning.analysis.Fit\") — the container the analysis stages read from and write to.\n"
msgstr "Rulează programul, apoi formatează rezultatele cu [`collect()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/circuit-generator-executor-circuit-generator#qiskit_noise_learning.circuit_generator.ExecutorCircuitGenerator.collect \"qiskit_noise_learning.circuit_generator.ExecutorCircuitGenerator.collect\"), pentru a produce un [`Fit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/analysis-fit#qiskit_noise_learning.analysis.Fit \"qiskit_noise_learning.analysis.Fit\") — containerul din care citesc și în care scriu etapele de analiză.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This step is the same whether the executor is pointed at a simulator or at a real device.\n"
msgstr "Acest pas este același indiferent dacă executorul este orientat către un simulator sau către un dispozitiv real.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"analyze-the-data\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "7. Analyze the data {#7-analyze-the-data}"
msgstr "7. Analizează datele {#7-analyze-the-data}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build an analysis pipeline around nonnegative least squares fitting of the model.\n"
msgstr "Construiește un flux de analiză în jurul potrivirii prin cele mai mici pătrate nenegative a modelului.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot the measured observable means against their fitted exponentials, one subplot per `CZ` pair, to see whether the decays being fitted are exponential at all.\n"
msgstr "Reprezintă grafic mediile observabilelor măsurate față de exponențialele lor potrivite, câte un subgrafic pentru fiecare pereche `CZ`, pentru a vedea dacă descreșterile potrivite sunt deloc exponențiale.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Swap `exponential_fit` for `model_prediction` to compare the same data against the decays implied by the rates that came out of the non-negative least squares solve.\n"
msgstr "Înlocuiește `exponential_fit` cu `model_prediction` pentru a compara aceleași date cu descreșterile implicate de ratele rezultate din rezolvarea prin cele mai mici pătrate nenegative.\n"
